      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544444458146594818",
      "text": "Perspective? Seriously? 1 perspective here; a violent hostage situation with innocent people &amp; 1 gunman. #Clear @paulwiggins @LibyaLiberty",
