      "parent_id": 5.444511580187566e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544443705315184640",
      "text": "@FitToPrint @LibyaLiberty  Interfaith leaders will have also spoken about perspective. They have before, and will again.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 10:47:49 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4444332730772685e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544469576185290752",
      "text": "@LibyaLiberty @FitToPrint @paulwiggins and bigotry is not derived from religion (love thy Neighbour) but weak brainwashed minds via cults",
